<title>POLAND: Polish NBP sells PLN 367 mln 91-day bills.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP sells PLN 367 mln 91-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 367 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills after Polish banks bid for 368 million, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average yield of the bills held flat at 22.20 percent.</p>
<p>The minimum accepted price was 9468.54 and the average price was 9468.55.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
